#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_table_sort
#! frames  270
#! poster  95
# A click on the header 'cells' sorts the blocks by their cells, largest first; a second click, smallest first. A
# click on 'residual' puts the largest residuals on top: their rows are coloured and marked '!'. The wheel scrolls the
# rows down to the last coloured ones; the header stays in place.
0   move 300 380
10  move 430 48 15
40  down
41  up
75  down
76  up
100 move 540 48 12
130 down
131 up
160 move 300 220 15
185 wheel 0 -3
200 wheel 0 -3
215 wheel 0 -3
230 wheel 0 -3
